      "id": "claim_67f0709af6b64ca6b8c9f9d392fdc229",
      "statement": "internal/backplane.ClientProvider is an interface with GetClient and GetPodExecutor methods, each taking a clusterID, actionName, and []RBACRule, implemented by BackplaneProvider (production, talks to the real backplane API) and KubeconfigProvider (local/dev, builds a rest.Config from a local kubeconfig).",
